Package: fastIWTlm
Type: Package
Title: Fast Interval-Wise Testing for Functional Regression with ggplot2 Visualisation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Matteo", "Fontana", email = "mtt.fnt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("fastIWTlm", "contributors", role = "ctb"))
Description: Interval-Wise Testing (IWT) for functional regression.
    Provides functional-on-scalar and functional-on-functional regression
    via 'fastIWTlm()' and a 'ggplot2'-based visualisation layer for 'IWTlm'
    objects ('autoplot.IWTlm()' and 'arrange_IWTlm()'). The permutation loop
    of 'fastIWTlm()' can optionally be dispatched to a parallel 'RcppEigen'
    kernel via 'engine = "rcpp"'. One- and two-sample interval-wise tests
    are provided by the companion package 'fdatestcpp'
    (<https://github.com/matteo-fontana/fdatestcpp>).
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen
Imports:
    Rcpp,
    ggplot2,
    data.table,
    stats,
